      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks like a possible error.\n\n**Ibuprofen 1600 mg by mouth four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.** That is double the maximum daily dose in the labeling (3,200 mg/day). The usual single-dose maximum is 800 mg, so 1600 mg per dose is also double that. For a 70 kg adult with normal renal and hepatic function, the typical range is 400\u2013800 mg per dose, up to 3,200 mg/day. High-dose NSAIDs also raise the risk of GI bleeding, renal injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nPlease confirm which you intend:\n\n1. **Ibuprofen 800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the labeled maximum)\n2. **Ibuprofen 600 mg PO every 6 hours** (2,400 mg/day)\n3. **Ibuprofen 1600 mg PO four times daily** as written, if you intend a supratherapeutic dose for a specific reason\n\nI'll enter whichever you choose. If you want option 3, tell me the indication so I can add it to the order note."
      }
